{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1549","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《剑南诗稿校注》卷十七（上海古籍出版社 1985 年版）。该诗为淳熙十三年（1186）春于会稽石帆别业所作，当时诗人62 岁。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10369-1"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"早岁：早年。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10369-2"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"那：同“哪”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10369-3"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"中原北望：指北望淮河以北沦陷在金人手中的地区。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10369-4"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"楼船夜雪瓜洲渡：指陆游40 岁任镇江通判时的事。当时，右丞相张浚督视江淮兵马，过镇江，颇赏识陆游。张浚积极督练军马，防敌备战，但朝廷偏向议和，张浚处境艰难，最后被罢相。楼船，有楼的高大战船。瓜洲渡，长江渡口，在江苏扬州，与镇江隔江相对。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10369-5"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"铁马秋风大散关：指陆游48 岁时在陕南汉中的经历。当时，诗人入四川宣抚使王炎幕府，活跃在大散关前线，并曾经与金兵交战。铁马，配有铁甲的战马。大散关，即散关，在陕西宝鸡西南大散岭上。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10369-6"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"塞上长城：化用南朝宋名将檀道济的事迹。檀道济率兵伐北魏，屡次建功，后遭猜忌被杀。他被拘捕前曾说：“乃复坏汝万里之长城！”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10369-7"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"名世：名显于世。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10369-8"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"伯仲间：指不相上下。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10369-9"}],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"书愤","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-10369-1","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"\n\n陆 游","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"早岁","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-10369-2","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"那","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-10369-3","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"知世事艰，中原北望","type":"text"},{"label":"[4]","noteId":"footnote-10369-4","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"气如山。\n\n楼船夜雪瓜洲渡","type":"text"},{"label":"[5]","noteId":"footnote-10369-5","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，铁马秋风大散关","type":"text"},{"label":"[6]","noteId":"footnote-10369-6","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。\n\n塞上长城","type":"text"},{"label":"[7]","noteId":"footnote-10369-7","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"空自许，镜中衰鬓已先斑。\n\n出师一表真名世","type":"text"},{"label":"[8]","noteId":"footnote-10369-8","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，千载谁堪伯仲间","type":"text"},{"label":"[9]","noteId":"footnote-10369-9","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"！","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"收复失地的宿志不得实现，而国土沦陷的愤懑却一如既往。诗人回忆起夜雪战船、秋风铁马的过去，想起自我期许的落空、失地收复的无望。通过感叹诸葛亮出师雄文，暗示朝野上下都是主降的碌碌小人。全诗感情沉郁，气韵浑厚，尤以颔联“楼船”“铁马”两句，雄放豪迈，为人们广泛传诵。诵读此诗，应体会诗作内容与诗人亲身经历的关系，理解“书愤”的丰富内涵。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e5%8f%a4%e8%af%97%e8%af%8d%e8%af%b5%e8%af%bb/%e4%b9%a6%e6%84%a4-%e9%99%86%e6%b8%b8","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e5%8f%a4%e8%af%97%e8%af%8d%e8%af%b5%e8%af%bb/%e4%b9%a6%e6%84%a4-%e9%99%86%e6%b8%b8","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e5%8f%a4%e8%af%97%e8%af%8d%e8%af%b5%e8%af%bb/%e4%b9%a6%e6%84%a4-%e9%99%86%e6%b8%b8","title":null}],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":10369,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"5487243dd8d14d65dfadc20ed544a999aaa318fc20c291462ea62c69e1eff320","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-07-30.2","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10369-1","postId":10369,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10369-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10369-2","postId":10369,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10369-2","text":"[2]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10369-3","postId":1